1777:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        commutation at its TRGO output (connected to Timer used in this function) each time
1778:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        the TI1 of the Interface Timer detect a commutation at its input TI1.
